    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "exemption";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Exempts carriage services under certain conditions.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the service is supplied by means of a telecommunications network (a primary network) that is connected to one or more line links or other facilities...";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The carriage service is exempt if the primary network supplies services between customer equipment and other such equipment.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 0.5000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/DescriptionLogic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "subclassOf";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Defines a subclass of 'carriage service' for exemption purposes.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) For the purposes of this section, a carriage service is an exempt service if...";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The primary network must supply services between customer equipment and other such equipment for the carriage service to be exempt.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::dl";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 0.5000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/AllenInterval>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "during";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Primary network's principal function is during the carriage service period.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) the principal function of the primary network is to supply carriage services between customer equipment connected to the primary network and other such equipment;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The primary network's principal function must be during the carriage service period for it to be exempt.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::interval_reasoning";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 0.5000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-ltl-4>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/telecommunications-act-1997-sec-32-ss-2-logic-ltl-4> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LTL>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "until";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Primary network cannot be used in carrying a communication between equipment connected to network units and other such equipment until the carriage service period ends.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(d) despite the connection or connections referred to in paragraph (a), the primary network cannot be used in carrying a communication, as a single transaction, between equipment connected to the network units and other such equipment;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The primary network must not be used in carrying a communication until the carriage service period ends.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::temporal_ltl";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 0.5000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
