    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the disclosure is made to, or to a member of the staff of, the ACMA; and  (b) the information or document may assist the ACMA to carry out its functions or powers.";
