    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of disclosing or using information without permission.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) information is disclosed to the person as permitted by subsection 295V(1) or (2) or 295W(1); and (b) the person uses or discloses the information;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The use or disclosure referred to in paragraph (b) of this subsection is not for a purpose connected with persons being alerted to the emergency or likely emergency concerned.";
