    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Temporal relation between information disclosure and use.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) information is disclosed to the person as permitted by subsection 295V(3) or 295W(2); and  (b) the person uses or discloses the information;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The temporal relation between information disclosure and use is that the use occurs after the disclosure.";
